n to vanish mysteriously, fate draws two girls together:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gambler detective, and a lone survivor who once escaped a sacrificial fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they must uncover the truth hidden beneath the veil of tradition and folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who seeks to play god?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who dares to defy the boundaries of science?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the so-called <i>truth</i> rises to the surface...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you still have the courage to reveal it to the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/67b0b7b5724921cd77c33be3b1c66784.avif?t=1747358593\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intriguing puzzles through a series of dynamic comic-style scenes, each frame uniquely styled and brimming with creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/8dc751eead92ee44807b189742763672.poster.avif?t=1747358593\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/8dc751eead92ee44807b189742763672.webm?t=1747358593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/8dc751eead92ee44807b189742763672.mp4?t=1747358593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/a96504c873945c7a